ven for those discplced by the galactic stuggle. Over the years as the UEF military was pushed back they began refeuling on the small world. With the increased activity it wasnt long until other parties also learned of its presence. Now a visous struggle is taking place, such that what was once known as a haven, is now only known as a haven of war.","size":"1024 × 1024","mapVersion":2,"fileSize":2749917,"sha256":"fe71a2173c9b280a410725899db7902ec008ae16a5438241588626264ac3b8f4","preview":"previews/HavenofWar.png","archive":"maps/HavenofWar.v0002.zip"},{"id":"Kerbin_Alliance","name":"Kerbin Alliance v3","description":"Kerbin Alliance v3 by Kerbin","size":"1024 × 1024","mapVersion":2,"fileSize":3950172,"sha256":"a40f3b4650f652deb8790b6acde607d6c6d7236d97eecca49adb9393d904714c","archive":"maps/Kerbin_Alliance_v3.v0002.zip"},{"id":"Kerbal_Island","name":"Kerbal Island","description":"Kerbal Island 20x20 on 8pl by Kerbin \u0026 Yorh_Dev","size":"1024 × 1024","mapVersion":3,"fileSize":3113429,"sha256":"69e9980dd56f056264890a7ed11df4350b13ec4d9992fec3e09e8296283e3481","archive":"maps/Kerbal_Island.v0003.zip"},{"id":"king_of_the_mountain","name":"king of the mountain","size":"2048 × 2048","mapVersion":3,"fileSize":10355809,"sha256":"cdf6f1ef20b6195c82b4da3d279c65cdc62b82ae558db8645190c2b442b5a518","archive":"maps/king_of_the_mountain.v0003.zip"},{"id":"Lost_Planet","name":"Lost Planet","size":"1024 × 1024","mapVersion":23,"fileSize":1424946,"sha256":"9fe81bc8a26a239b92a3516eb019c711b4af64bdd86c8213aaf102ee5dbcb1b2","archive":"maps/Lost_Planet.v0023.zip"},{"id":"mass_storage","name":"mass storage","size":"1024 × 1024","mapVersion":2,"fileSize":661879,"sha256":"0dd93fcbf4c43ae2ed174b81d1a8a362505ba40527f33bbb40a244daa099977a","archive":"maps/mass_storage.v0002.zip"},{"id":"Master_of_the_seas","name":"Master of the seas","size":"2048 × 2048","mapVersion":4,"fileSize":12648690,"sha256":"81d93728ae2d16de14ee87e76d7a98cbba672969fd55a47633dad5bbf3beb907","archive":"maps/Master_of_